    <statement><p>Evaluate the definite integral</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle \int_{ 4 } ^ { 9 } (3x^{2}-8x+8) dx =</m> <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{3}{3}\cdot 9^{3}-\frac{8}{2}\cdot 9^{2}+8\cdot 9-\left(\frac{3}{3}\cdot 4^{3}-\frac{8}{2}\cdot 4^{2}+8\cdot 4\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
